TrustPageTitle=Before setup changes anything
TrustPageSubtitle=See exactly what Claude Aura installs
UnsignedTrustPageTitle=Unsigned installer
UnsignedTrustPageSubtitle=Windows cannot verify the publisher. Continue only with the official GitHub release asset and its matching SHA-256.
TrustIntro=Claude Aura changes only local files owned by Aura.
FactLiveTitle=LIVE CLAUDE WEBSITE
FactLiveBody=Opens claude.ai in a dedicated Microsoft Edge WebView2 window.
FactAccountTitle=YOUR WINDOWS ACCOUNT
FactAccountBody=Installs only for this Windows account and does not request administrator access.
FactDesktopTitle=CLAUDE DESKTOP
FactDesktopBody=Does not patch, replace, or reconfigure Claude Desktop.
FactDataTitle=LOCAL DATA
FactDataBody=Themes and Aura's separate sign-in data stay on this device. Uninstall can keep or remove them.
InstallPathsTitle=Local paths
AppPathLabel=Application
DataPathLabel=Settings
WebviewPathLabel=Sign-in profile
NodeReady=Ready — Node.js %1 detected
NodeRequired=Action needed — Node.js 22 or newer is required
NodeRefresh=Check again
NodeDownloadLink=Action needed — Download Node.js from nodejs.org
NodeBlockedTitle=Install Node.js 22 or newer first
NodeBlockedBody=Install Node.js 22 or newer from nodejs.org, then close and run Setup again.
WebViewReady=Ready — Microsoft Edge WebView2 %1 detected
WebViewRequired=Action needed — Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime is required
WebViewDownloadLink=Action needed — Download WebView2 Runtime from Microsoft
WebViewBlockedTitle=Install Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime first
WebViewBlockedBody=Install or repair the Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime, then close and run Setup again.
AdminBlockedBody=Close Setup, then open it normally. Claude Aura is a per-user app and must not be installed with administrator rights.
AuraRunningBody=Claude Aura is open. Exit Aura from its window or tray, then run Setup again.
DesktopTask=Create Claude Aura and Studio shortcuts on the Desktop
DesktopTaskGroup=Shortcuts
AuraShortcutComment=Open claude.ai with Aura themes
StudioShortcutComment=Open Claude Aura Studio
InstallStatus=Validating and installing Claude Aura…
InstallFailureTitle=Setup could not finish
InstallFailureBody=Setup could not install Claude Aura. Any incomplete app update was rolled back. Exit Aura if it is open, then try again. A technical log was saved in your Temp folder.
InstallCleanupWarningTitle=Installed, with cleanup still pending
InstallCleanupWarningBody=Claude Aura is installed, but Setup could not finish removing the previous app backup. Run Setup again to complete cleanup before the next update.
InstallRollbackFailureTitle=The previous app could not be restored
InstallRollbackFailureBody=Do not launch Claude Aura. Run Setup again and review the technical log in your Temp folder.
LaunchAura=Open Claude Aura
UninstallShortcut=Uninstall Claude Aura
UninstallShortcutComment=Remove Claude Aura and choose whether to keep local data
UninstallChoiceTitle=Uninstall Claude Aura?
UninstallChoiceBody=Choose whether to keep your local themes, settings, and Aura's separate WebView2 sign-in data. Claude Desktop and your Claude account will not change.
UninstallKeepButton=Keep local data
UninstallKeepHint=Remove the app and shortcuts only, ready for a later reinstall
UninstallRemoveButton=Remove local data too
UninstallRemoveHint=Also delete themes, settings, and Aura sign-in data; this cannot be undone
UninstallStatus=Removing Claude Aura…
UninstallFailureTitle=Uninstall could not finish
UninstallFailureBody=Exit Claude Aura, then try again. The app and data were not fully removed.
